  "description": "Chan Gu, a 20-year-old who works hard to support his younger siblings and frail mother, gets hit in the face with a baseball bat by a livestreaming \"neotuber\" named Zia Kwon on his way home from work. Eager to make up for her mistake, she brings him on to her channel for an apology video, but his natural charm leads to her suggesting the two of them start a new channel. Enticed by the money, he agrees, and the two start to grow close, but he worries his familial responsibilities will get in the way.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
